  "_readme": "Copy to secrets.json (git-ignored, repository root) and fill in. ONE file for everything: one block per environment (local = ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT Development, mock = app demo data, staging, production), and in each block one section per project: Api = the API, Admin = the admin portal, App = the mobile app (built in by ./set-app-env.sh - never put server secrets there). Every setting lives here, not in appsettings.json. Real environment variables (e.g. Storage__Minio__AccessKey) override this file. A property named ...Json keeps an object as raw JSON (paste the Firebase service-account JSON there).",
